<title>NORWAY: Norway's Feb PPI fell 0.4 pct mnth/mnth.</title>
<headline>Norway's Feb PPI fell 0.4 pct mnth/mnth.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Norway issued the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> NORWAY PRODUCER PRICES     FEB 1997   JAN 1997  FEB 1996</p>
<p> Month-on-month change	  -0.4	 +0.4	+0.3</p>
<p> Year-on-year change	    +1.7	 +2.3	+1.7</p>
<p> Index (base 1981)	     160.7	161.3     158.0</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
